          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "WRITING MIDI\n\nThe Midi Write nodes can be used to write notes and cc messages to other midi devices. You specify the channel, value, pitch and velocity. Send a trigger into the Write inlet to write the midi message."
          }
